registry={'schemaVersion':1,'kind':'eastern-arena-research-registry','scope':'15 current Eastern franchises, regular-season and postseason 1985-86 onward; physical sites and actual fixture anchors. Not an approved effective-date implementation manifest.','generatedAt':datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat(),'sourceSnapshot':{'path':'../../../../../../fullcourt/docs/audit/release-numbers-20261020/team-oracle/snapshot.json.gz','gzipSha256':json.loads((P/'fixture-identity-check.json').read_text())['snapshotGzipSha256']},'sites':coords,'episodes':rows,'secondaryFixtureObservations':secondary,'knownGaps':['Effective base bounds before first home fixture require explicit root policy.','BOS Hartford and WAS Baltimore secondary fixtures not exhaustively sourced here.','NBA historical venue labels are retroactively overwritten for many early fixtures and cannot alone certify physical identity.','GeoNames points for Omni, Boston Garden, Chicago Stadium, Spectrum, and Capital Centre are original venue points but not independently roof-footprint-certified here.','Standing arena named-place marker is an original provider location, not a surveyed center.','Preseason games, international/bubble neutral venue registry, and exhaustive special-fixture adjudication remain outside this research delivery.']}
